      "content": "i get that but i cant even sleep or work right now cuz of the pressure in my face. my doctor is never around and i can't wait 3 days for an appointment just to ask about an over the counter pill. i've taken lisinopril for years and my BP is usually really stable. are you sure it's not fine just for a night or two? like, is there a specific dose that's safe or can i just take a half pill to be safe?",
